{"id":"e_ternellement","lemma":"éternellement","pos":"adv","rank":3613,"glosses":["eternally"],"ipa":"/e.tɛʁ.nɛl.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/1c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-%C3%A9ternellement.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-%C3%A9ternellement.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ils ne peuvent nous protéger éternellement.","en":"They can't protect us forever.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to protect"},null]},{"text":"Je vais vivre éternellement.","en":"I'm going to live forever.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to live"},null]},{"text":"Je ne peux pas vous cacher éternellement.","en":"I can't hide you forever.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to hide"},null]},{"text":"Les gens ne peuvent pas vivre éternellement.","en":"People can't live forever.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to live"},null]},{"text":"Je sais que rien ne dure éternellement.","en":"I know nothing lasts forever.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to last","l":"durer"},null]}]}